caption: Duration
technology-rule: duration

The default duration is one minute.

| Final duration | Modifier |
| --- | --- |
| About 1 second | -80% |
| 2 seconds | -60% |
| 6 seconds | -40% |
| 20 seconds | -20% |
| 1 minute | +0% |
| 3 minutes | +20% |
| 10 minutes | +40% |
| 30 minutes | +60% |
| 100 minutes | +80% |
| 300 minutes | +100% |
| 1,000 minutes | +120% |

Reduced Duration uses the inverse of the normal Extended Duration progression.
